# TeiaCareSDK Changelog

## [0.2.6] - 2026-10-15
### Fixed
- One Conan recipe revision per release: version.cpp is generated in the build directory instead of the source tree
- No CRLF conversion on Windows checkouts (the Windows jobs exported a different recipe)
### Changed
- CD deploys only on v* tags and uploads only teiacare_sdk/<version>, never "*"
- CI resolves third-party Conan 2 packages from teiacare_conan2; teiacare serves only teiacare_*

## [0.2.5] - 2026-04-21
### Added
- IoU and NMS to geometry module
### Changed
- Migrate build toolchain to Conan 2 and venvpp2
- Ship CI-owned Conan profiles for multi-platform GitHub Actions
- Use Conan 2 `--index` flag for remote registration
- Point scripts submodule to TeiaCare/venvpp2
### Fixed
- Rectangle initialization for floating point precision in reshape test
- Disable example builds in CMake configuration for unit tests
